        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Because every case and sticker sheet is printed specifically for you, we are only able to offer returns or exchanges if your item arrives damaged, defective, or doesn't match what you ordered.</p><p>Contact us within 7 days of delivery with your order number and a photo of the issue, and we will arrange a replacement or refund. Change-of-mind returns are not accepted on custom-printed items.</p>"
          }
        }
